From: LubanCat BSP <dev@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: rockchip: enable hdmi0 on lubancat-4-v1

LubanCat-4 V1 的板级 dts 没有 include 厂商自带的显示路由片段
rk3588s-lubancat-4-hdmi0-vp0.dtsi，于是：
  - &hdmi0 保持 dtsi 默认的 status = "disabled"
  - hdmi0_in_vp0/vp1/vp2 三个 endpoint 也全 disabled
  - VOP2 找不到任何使能的输出 → "No crtc register, please check dts config"
    → display-subsystem 绑定失败（-19）→ 没有任何显示 DRM 设备

内核树里这个 dtsi 已经存在（含 enable-gpios = <&gpio4 RK_PB6>、
route_hdmi0 -> vp0_out_hdmi0、hdptxphy_hdmi0、hdmi0_sound），
只是板级 dts 没引用它。补一行 include 即可。

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [BSP-specific]

---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588s-lubancat-4-v1.dts | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588s-lubancat-4-v1.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588s-lubancat-4-v1.dts
@@ -7,6 +7,7 @@
 /dts-v1/;
 
 #include "rk3588s-lubancat-4.dts"
+#include "rk3588s-lubancat-4-hdmi0-vp0.dtsi"
 
 / {
 	model = "Embedfire LubanCat-4 V1";
